          "id": "d3a9e934c02169ea35bc0356695a8a6138db200c",
          "message": "Add Turtle provenance serializers [GPT-5.6] (#2250)\n\nAdd prefix-compacted Turtle output to Derivation and UpdateDerivation over their existing prov_graph triple sets, with exact round-trip tests and public-surface documentation.\n\nNon-vacuity verified: temporarily replacing both methods with the N-Triples fallback made both direct tests fail on their pinned prov: tokens; restoring the implementation made them pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
