          "id": "885cf0f87eff74faa6a86e239808bb2fc0336b4c",
          "message": "Advertise bound HTTP/3 listeners via Alt-Svc [GPT-5.6] (#2252)\n\nAdd a shared Alt-Svc response layer and apply it to each TCP router only after the QUIC endpoint binds. Cover live-port advertisements and unconfigured absence across both servers.\n\nMutation witness: changed the shared header name to x-alt-svc; the shared, sparq-server, and sparq-lws-core acceptance tests each failed, then passed after restoration.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
