          "distinct": false,
          "id": "63e1a2cfddae8402c3514822fbbf910c833515e1",
          "message": "feat(rsp): add median window aggregate [GPT-5.6] (#2260)\n\nAdd deterministic odd/even median folding over the shared sorted numeric window bindings, and document the public aggregate variant.\n\nTests pin odd, even, empty, and unbound cases. Non-vacuity was verified: replacing the even average with the upper middle value and changing the odd expected value both made the focused oracle fail.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
