          "id": "308392ec75afca0be2694e46c90fb05ab01a3c93",
          "message": "Add metadata-only Parquet row count [GPT-5.6] (#2261)\n\nExpose parquet_row_count_from_bytes through the existing parquet feature and document the public API in the crate README and Arrow usage skill.\n\nAdd value-pinned coverage for exactly three rows, including an all-unbound row, plus the empty-result count. Mutation witness verified: substituting the two-column schema count for metadata num_rows makes the three-row test fail before restoring the implementation.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
